<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Memory Management Pr=
inciples:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Proactive Strategy Sele=
ction</strong> - Choose processing approach based on available memory</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Graceful Degradation</s=
trong> - Fall back to streaming/progressive loading under pressure</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Pressure Detecti=
on</strong> - Monitor heap usage and respond to memory warnings</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cleanup &amp; Garbage C=
ollection</strong> - Explicit worker termination and data dereferencing</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Production Monitoring</=
strong> - Track memory usage patterns for optimization</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The beauty of this approach is t=
hat it <strong>automatically adapts to the user's device capabilities</stro=
ng> while maintaining data processing functionality even on memory-constrai=
ned devices.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Fa=
ntastic! Your progressive degradation strategy shows real production awaren=
ess. Now let's get into some hands-on coding. I'd like you to implement a s=
pecific scenario: We need to build a Web Worker that processes real-time cu=
rrency exchange rate data. The data comes in as a continuous stream of JSON=
 objects, but we need to batch them into 5-second windows and calculate mov=
ing averages.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The challenge is that we need to=
 preserve calculation precision for regulatory compliance, and we need to h=
andle the case where the data rate varies significantly - sometimes 10 upda=
tes per second, sometimes 1000 updates per second during market volatility.=
</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Can you implement this with live=
 coding? Show me the worker implementation and the main thread coordination=
.</p>
