<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>3. Regul=
atory Compliance Features</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Audit Trail</strong>: E=
very calculation step is logged for regulatory review</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data Integrity</strong>=
: Hash verification to detect corruption during transfer</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Precision Preservation<=
/strong>: All monetary values stored/transferred as exact decimals</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Timestamp Accuracy</str=
ong>: Microsecond precision for trade timing</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>4. Produ=
ction-Ready Error Handling</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Worker Crash Recovery</=
strong>: Automatic worker reinitialization</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>WebSocket Reconnection<=
/strong>: Exponential backoff strategy</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Monitoring</stro=
ng>: Real-time heap usage tracking</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Metrics</st=
rong>: Comprehensive latency and throughput monitoring</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5"><strong>Performa=
nce Characteristics</strong></h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">For the <strong>high-frequency s=
cenario</strong> (1000 updates/sec):</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Transferable Objects</s=
trong> ensure zero-copy data transfer</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Batching</strong> reduc=
es processing overhead from 1000 to ~200 operations/sec</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Rate limiting</strong> =
prevents UI thread blocking</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Early processing</stron=
g> prevents memory buildup</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">For the <strong>low-frequency sc=
enario</strong> (10 updates/sec):</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Timer-based batching</s=
trong> ensures consistent 5-second windows</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Minimal overhead</stron=
g> through optimized data structures</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Immediate processing</s=
trong> for responsive UI updates</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Im=
