quirements thoroughly. Let me dive into a few specific areas:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">First, regarding the precision h=
andling - you mentioned using Decimal.js in the worker but storing values a=
s strings when transferring back to the main thread. How would you handle a=
 scenario where you need to perform cross-currency calculations that involv=
e multiple precision requirements? For instance, calculating a portfolio va=
lue where you have positions in JPY (0 decimal places), USD (2 decimal plac=
es), and BTC (8 decimal places)?</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Exce=
