t complex challenges in financial systems</strong>. The key insight is that=
 precision requirements aren't just about decimal places - they're about <s=
trong>regulatory compliance</strong>, <strong>rounding rules</strong>, and =
<strong>currency-specific calculation standards</strong>.</p>
