<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This approach ensures that wheth=
er we're calculating a $100 USD trade or a =C2=A510,000,000 JPY portfolio w=
ith Bitcoin holdings, <strong>every decimal place is accounted for and comp=
liant</strong> with both regulatory requirements and mathematical precision=
 standards.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ex=
cellent approach to multi-currency precision! I can see you understand the =
regulatory implications well. Now, let's talk about scaling. Imagine we're =
rolling this out to NAB's entire trading floor - 500+ traders, each potenti=
ally subscribed to 50+ currency pairs, during a major market event like a c=
entral bank announcement.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How would you modify your archit=
ecture to handle this scale? Specifically, I'm interested in your approach =
to worker pool management and the potential bottlenecks you'd anticipate.</=
p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: That=
